, "note": 15, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 172, "note": 14, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 208, "note": 17, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 212, "note": 12, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 216, "note": 15, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 220, "note": 14, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 224, "note": 17, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 228, "note": 12, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 232, "note": 15, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 236, "note": 14, "duration": 4}]}, "toplines": {"type": "notes", "channel": 9, "notes": [{"beat": 16, "note": 99, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 96, "note": 99, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 176, "note": 99, "duration": 4}]}, "voix": {"type": "notes", "channel": 12, "notes": [{"beat": 0, "note": 24, "duration": 4}]}, "lyrics": {"type": "lyrics", "lyrics": [{"beat": 0, "text": ""}, {"beat": 4, "text": "[intro]"}, {"beat": 36, "text": "J'ouvre mon frigo, plein de l\u00e9gumes color\u00e9s,"}, {"beat": 44, "text": "Des courgettes, des \u00e9pinards, on va s'regaler !"}, {"beat": 52, "text": "Je coupe les oignons, les tomates en d\u00e9s,"}, {"beat": 60, "text": "Dans ma cuisine, c'est l'\u00e9clate assur\u00e9e !"}, {"beat": 68, "text": "J'aime cuisiner des lasagnes bien gratin\u00e9es,"}, {"beat": 76, "text": "Sans viande, c'est mon secret pour me r\u00e9galer !"}, {"beat": 84, "text": "Des l\u00e9gumes, du fromage, un plat revisit\u00e9,"}, {"beat": 92, "text": "Mes lasagnes v\u00e9g\u00e9tariennes, je vais tout d\u00e9vorer !"}, {"beat": 100, "text": "[ \u2026 ]"}, {"beat": 116, "text": "Je fais mijoter mes l\u00e9gumes dans une po\u00eale,"}, {"beat": 124, "text": "Avec des herbes, une pointe d'ail, c'est un r\u00e9gal !"}, {"beat": 132, "text": "Je pr\u00e9pare ma b\u00e9chamel, bien onctueuse et belle,"}, {"beat": 140, "text": "Mon assiette sera garnie, une explosion de saveurs !"}, {"beat": 148, "text": "J'aime cuisiner des lasagnes bien gratin\u00e9es,"}, {"beat": 156, "text": "Sans viande, c'est mon secret pour me r\u00e9galer !"}, {"beat": 164, "text": "Des l\u00e9gumes, du fromage, un plat revisit\u00e9,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "Mes lasagnes v\u00e9g\u00e9tariennes, je vais tout d\u00e9vorer !"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Alors si tu veux te r\u00e9galer sans bidoche,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Les lasagnes v\u00e9g\u00e9tariennes sont un poche-poche !"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Viens dans ma cuisine, viens faire la f\u00eate,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "On va se r\u00e9galer avec cette recette !"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}